return ['domain'=>'wp-knowledge-chat','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'id_ID','project-id-version'=>'WP Knowledge Chat 0.2.0','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-26T02:42:23+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-14 00:00+0000','x-generator'=>'WP-CLI 2.12.0','messages'=>['AI backend'=>'Backend AI','About'=>'Tentang','Article'=>'Artikel','Backend is not configured.'=>'Backend belum dikonfigurasi.','Browser Language'=>'Bahasa Browser','Browser Language must be checked or unchecked.'=>'Bahasa Browser harus dicentang atau tidak dicentang.','Business Development / Strategy'=>'Pengembangan Bisnis / Strategi','C-level / Director'=>'Direksi / C-level','Chat assistant'=>'Asisten obrolan','Chat widget'=>'Widget obrolan','Company / Role'=>'Perusahaan / Peran','Configured.'=>'Terkonfigurasi.','Connection test failed (HTTP status %d). Check the backend URL and that the service is running.'=>'Uji koneksi gagal (status HTTP %d). Periksa URL backend dan pastikan layanan berjalan.','Connection test failed: the backend is running but its knowledge base is empty.'=>'Uji koneksi gagal: backend berjalan tetapi basis pengetahuannya kosong.','Connection test failed: the backend rejected the shared secret. Check that WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_SHARED_SECRET matches CHAT_SHARED_SECRET and that the server clock is correct.'=>'Uji koneksi gagal: backend menolak shared secret. Pastikan WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_SHARED_SECRET sama dengan CHAT_SHARED_SECRET dan jam server sudah benar.','Connection test: backend is reachable, the shared secret is accepted and the knowledge base is ready.'=>'Uji koneksi: backend dapat dijangkau, shared secret diterima, dan basis pengetahuan siap.','Consultation requests'=>'Permintaan konsultasi','Contact'=>'Kontak','Contact URL'=>'URL Kontak','Contact details'=>'Detail Kontak','Conversation storage'=>'Penyimpanan percakapan','Default Language'=>'Bahasa Default','Default language must be English (en), Indonesian (id), Korean (ko), Japanese (ja) or Simplified Chinese (zh).'=>'Bahasa default harus Inggris (en), Indonesia (id), Korea (ko), Jepang (ja), atau Mandarin Sederhana (zh).','Enable Chatbot'=>'Aktifkan Chatbot','Enable Chatbot must be checked or unchecked.'=>'Aktifkan Chatbot harus dicentang atau tidak dicentang.','FAQ'=>'FAQ','Finance / Investment'=>'Keuangan / Investasi','Function'=>'Fungsi','Greeting Messages'=>'Pesan Sapaan','Greeting message is required.'=>'Pesan sapaan wajib diisi.','Greeting message must be %d characters or fewer.'=>'Pesan sapaan maksimal %d karakter.','Greeting message must be text.'=>'Pesan sapaan harus berupa teks.','Home'=>'Beranda','Human Resources'=>'Sumber Daya Manusia','Index token or backend URL is not configured.'=>'Token indeks atau URL backend belum dikonfigurasi.','Inpartner'=>'Inpartner','Inpartner AI Business Consultation Assistant: a floating chat widget that answers visitor questions from approved website content via a separate AI backend.'=>'Inpartner AI Business Consultation Assistant: widget obrolan mengambang yang menjawab pertanyaan pengunjung dari konten situs yang telah disetujui melalui backend AI terpisah.','Interface language and preferred answer language when the visitor has not chosen one. Source content is not altered.'=>'Bahasa antarmuka dan bahasa jawaban yang diutamakan jika pengunjung belum memilih. Konten sumber tidak diubah.','Job Title'=>'Jabatan','Language Switcher'=>'Pengalih Bahasa','Language Switcher must be checked or unchecked.'=>'Pengalih Bahasa harus dicentang atau tidak dicentang.','Legal / Compliance'=>'Hukum / Kepatuhan','Let visitors switch between English, Bahasa Indonesia, 한국어, 日本語 and 简体中文 in the chat header.'=>'Izinkan pengunjung beralih antara English, Bahasa Indonesia, 한국어, 日本語, dan 简体中文 di header obrolan.','Not configured.'=>'Belum dikonfigurasi.','Operations / Supply Chain'=>'Operasional / Rantai Pasok','Other'=>'Lainnya','Owner / Founder'=>'Pemilik / Pendiri','Questions and answers'=>'Pertanyaan dan jawaban','Sales & Marketing'=>'Penjualan & Pemasaran','Service'=>'Layanan','Settings'=>'Pengaturan','Settings were not saved: invalid input.'=>'Pengaturan tidak disimpan: input tidak valid.','Show less'=>'Tampilkan lebih sedikit','Show more'=>'Tampilkan selengkapnya','Show the chat widget on the public site.'=>'Tampilkan widget obrolan di situs publik.','Shown when the chat opens, in the visitor\'s language. Plain text only (HTML is removed). Maximum %d characters. Leave a field empty to restore its default.'=>'Ditampilkan saat obrolan dibuka, dalam bahasa pengunjung. Hanya teks biasa (HTML dihapus). Maksimal %d karakter. Kosongkan kolom untuk mengembalikan sapaan bawaan.','Start in the visitor\'s browser language when it is supported; otherwise use the default language.'=>'Mulai dengan bahasa browser pengunjung jika didukung; jika tidak, gunakan bahasa default.','Test connection'=>'Uji koneksi','The backend URL and shared secret are read from wp-config.php and are never shown here or sent to browsers.'=>'URL backend dan shared secret dibaca dari wp-config.php dan tidak pernah ditampilkan di sini atau dikirim ke browser.','The conversation is kept only in the visitor\'s browser (session storage) and is cleared when the tab is closed. This site stores short-lived rate-limit counters, aggregate counts of questions and the 25 most recent question snippets, from which e-mail addresses, phone numbers, links and long numbers have been removed.'=>'Percakapan hanya disimpan di browser pengunjung (session storage) dan dihapus saat tab ditutup. Situs ini menyimpan penghitung pembatasan laju berumur pendek, jumlah agregat pertanyaan, dan 25 cuplikan pertanyaan terbaru yang alamat e-mail, nomor telepon, tautan, dan angka panjangnya telah dihapus.','The widget stays hidden until WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_BACKEND_URL (https) and WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_SHARED_SECRET (32+ characters) are defined in wp-config.php.'=>'Widget tetap tersembunyi sampai WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_BACKEND_URL (https) dan WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_SHARED_SECRET (minimal 32 karakter) didefinisikan di wp-config.php.','Visitors can ask questions in a chat assistant. The text of each question is sent to our AI backend service and, together with excerpts of public pages of this website, to Google Gemini to write the answer. The visitor\'s IP address, cookies and identity are not sent; a salted one-way identifier is used for rate limiting.'=>'Pengunjung dapat mengajukan pertanyaan melalui asisten obrolan. Teks setiap pertanyaan dikirim ke layanan backend AI kami dan, bersama kutipan halaman publik situs ini, ke Google Gemini untuk menyusun jawaban. Alamat IP, cookie, dan identitas pengunjung tidak dikirim; pengenal satu arah yang diberi salt digunakan untuk pembatasan laju.','Visitors can optionally send a consultation request. The name, e-mail address, company, job title, function and message they enter are stored on this site and e-mailed to the site administrator. The IP address is not stored. Requests are kept until an administrator deletes them, or for the retention period the site owner has set, and can be exported or erased through Tools → Export Personal Data and Erase Personal Data.'=>'Pengunjung dapat secara opsional mengirim permintaan konsultasi. Nama, alamat e-mail, perusahaan, jabatan, fungsi, dan pesan yang mereka isi disimpan di situs ini dan dikirim lewat e-mail ke administrator situs. Alamat IP tidak disimpan. Permintaan disimpan sampai administrator menghapusnya, atau selama masa retensi yang ditetapkan pemilik situs, dan dapat diekspor atau dihapus melalui Alat → Ekspor Data Pribadi dan Hapus Data Pribadi.','WP Knowledge Chat'=>'WP Knowledge Chat','WP Knowledge Chat Settings'=>'Pengaturan WP Knowledge Chat','WP Knowledge Chat leads'=>'Permintaan konsultasi WP Knowledge Chat','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk melakukan ini.','You do not have permission to manage these settings.'=>'Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk mengelola pengaturan ini.']];
